                <pb facs="0807" n="713" xml:id="pg713"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yours of yesterday respecting <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> passengers
                    received and acted upon. What is situation to-day? Cable.</p>
            </div>
